      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-dd9920c530190e1cab5474b3",
        "path_or_url": "storage.md",
        "section": "Journal storage > Historical default",
        "snippet": "## Historical default\n\nThe retired prototype deleted files after two days without checking exports. This behaviour is documented for migration diagnosis and is not the live service policy.\n",
